cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the research article specified in preferred-citation."
title: "Reframing AI for Rare Disease Recognition"
abstract: >-
  Research workflow for rare disease recognition using Qwen3-8B embedding
  and reranker models, covering retrieval, reranking, fine-tuning, and
  downstream evaluation across HPC, local Jupyter, and Databricks environments.
  Includes disease knowledge summaries generated by Claude Sonnet 4,
  DeepSeek R1, Gemini 2.5 Pro, and OpenAI o3 for fine-tuning and adaptation
  to rare disease prioritization tasks.
